---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How London Travel Geek handles visitor information and third-party content."
>
  <article class="legal container">
    <p class="eyebrow">London Travel Geek</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="legal__intro">
      This page describes the current version of the website. It should be
      reviewed whenever analytics, advertising, comments, forms or a newsletter
      provider are activated.
    </p>

    <h2>Information collected by this website</h2>
    <p>
      London Travel Geek does not currently provide user accounts, accept
      comments or operate an email signup form. The website itself does not set
      advertising or analytics cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting and technical logs</h2>
    <p>
      The hosting provider may process standard technical information, such as
      IP addresses, browser details and request logs, to deliver and protect the
      website. Its own privacy and retention terms apply to that processing.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party content and links</h2>
    <p>
      Articles may link to transport providers, restaurants, booking services,
      maps and other external websites. Their privacy policies apply after you
      follow those links. YouTube videos use a click-to-load privacy-enhanced
      player, so the player is not requested until you choose to play a video.
    </p>

    <h2>Future services</h2>
    <p>
      This notice must be updated before enabling analytics, personalised
      advertising, newsletter subscriptions, comments or any other service that
      collects personal information or stores cookies.
    </p>

    <p><a href="/">Return to the London Travel Geek homepage</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 52rem;
    padding-block: var(--space-7);
  }

  .legal h1 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal__intro {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
  }

  .legal p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .legal a {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 750;
  }
</style>
